me_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4457, "last_played": 1772904730, "avatar": "2e0d97caf0c1bd0bf8e1acb2523d9d4718a79001"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1764517469, "timestamp_updated": 1764517469, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "211956877", "author": {"steamid": "76561198837703163", "personaname": "D0nuT", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198837703163/", "num_games_owned": 177, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 4992, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2936, "last_played": 1765336128, "avatar": "c9d603c1a0e08d2894389e6953df9f946b298e77"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is not bad by itself, gameplay is everything u knew from previous titles in the series, the only new addition is Propaganda missions. Game, as usual with Asura engine lacks proper anti-alliasing option, unless u playing on 4k resolution. Biggest downsight is the fact that developers just decided to recycle some maps from SE 5. If u gonna buy it on bigger sale, u gonna be satisfied.", "timestamp_created": 1764516412, "timestamp_updated": 1764516412, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.516238152980804443", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "211836632", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072295204", "personaname": "≡ WOLF ≡", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198072295204/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 178, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 178, "last_played": 1764504543, "avatar": "48f36256cccb1f65287c2323f27e3bd806139331"}, "language": "english", "review": "It seems a bit redundant being similar to Sniper Elite 5, with a few small changes from its predecessor, which isn't necessarily the worst thing that could have happened :)", "timestamp_created": 1764492382, "timestamp_updated": 1764567655, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.65015101432800293", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "211788894", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989808210", "personaname": "Twindongz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/twindongz/", "num_games_owned": 613, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 702, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 390, "last_played": 1764540744, "avatar": "fc14d2776ed9db130b6a2f9327395d2dd5a95812"}, "language": "english", "review": "The overall experience feels incredibly unpolished, with awkward movement mechanics that detract from the gameplay. Character navigation feels clunky, especially when trying to vault over small obstacles or maneuver around minor rubble and debris. This lack of fluidity gives the game an outdated, almost early-2000s feel, which is a significant step back from previous Sniper Elite titles.\r\n\r\nI’m glad I didn’t pay more than $20 for it, because this entry feels like a downgrade, rather than an upgrade, compared to its predecessors. To make matters worse, the game has been monetized to the point where additional DLCs, which should have been part of the base game, are being sold as extra content. The inclusion of paid skins and levels feels like a cash grab, undermining the core experience.\r\n\r\nIt’s disappointing to see what was once a standout franchise take such a turn. It feels like the end of an era for Sniper Elite.", "timestamp_created": 1764469088, "timestamp_updated": 1764469088, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507239818572998047", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "211736228", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009602290", "personaname": "Ned Ludd", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198009602290/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 4568, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 676, "last_played": 1789754010, "avatar": "f908bf1223d717dbabe50ebfc38dc065b0cce64e"}, "language": "english", "review": "i enjoy it , the only thing that bugs me is when you have to keep running around after youve killed everybody just to find some files , it seems to happen quite often that they create a maze of rooms and corridors that dont lead you where they should .", "timestamp_created": 1764448925, "timestamp_updated": 1764448925, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}